OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,APatrols to start in places visited by
OL,4,Aasylum seekers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe initiative, named Operation
OL,7,FVanguard, was launched in direct
OL,8,Fresponse to concerns raised by
OL,9,Fresidents and would "deter anti-social
OL,10,Fbehaviour", it added.
OL,12,FIt came after the government said it
OL,13,Fwas looking to increase the number of
OL,14,Fpeople at MDP Wethersfield - which has
OL,15,Fbeen used to house single male migrants
OL,16,Fsince 2023 - from about 800 to 1,220.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
